            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marwadi for a fair, then the Marwadi for a weekly market."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: यो",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "यो — yo — \"this\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "CDIAL lists Hindi yah, \"this\", under Sanskrit eṣa, \"this\" (CDIAL 2530). It gives no Marwari form, so the exact path to यो (yo) is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
